    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-D14F2A7786128A49-Q8">
      <question_stem>확률변수 $X$에 대한 누적 확률 $P ( X \leq x )$가 다음과 같을 때, 옳지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="O/X 판별 조합형" category="복합 보기 검증형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>확률변수 $X$</keyword>
        <keyword>P ( X geq 5 )</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$P ( X geq 5 ) = \frac{2}{3}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>[유형] 복합 보기 검증형 · O·X 판별 조합형
[키워드] 확률변수 $X$, P ( X geq 5 )
[풀이] 옳지 않은 것을 고르는 문제다. 틀린 선지는 ③, 옳은 선지는 ①·②·④이다.
[근거] “$P ( X \leq x ) = {\left\{\begin{array}{ll}0 , &amp; x &lt; 0 \\ \frac{1}{6} x , &amp; 0 \leq x &lt; 2 \\ \frac{1}{2} , &amp; 2 \leq x &lt; 4 \\ \frac{1}{6} x , &amp; 4 \leq x &lt; 6 \\ 1 , &amp; x \geq 6\end{array}\right.}$”</overall_commentary>
      <passage_evidence>$P ( X \leq x ) = {\left\{\begin{array}{ll}0 , &amp; x &lt; 0 \\ \frac{1}{6} x , &amp; 0 \leq x &lt; 2 \\ \frac{1}{2} , &amp; 2 \leq x &lt; 4 \\ \frac{1}{6} x , &amp; 4 \leq x &lt; 6 \\ 1 , &amp; x \geq 6\end{array}\right.}$</passage_evidence>
      <choice_explanations>
